{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "保", "id": "保"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "憂", "id": "憂"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.698669046162043, "source": "臣", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.9102116857977729, "source": "臣", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.5163474893680884, "source": "臣", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.3621968095408301, "source": "臣", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 3.048595763111059, "source": "天", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 3.153956278768885, "source": "天", "target": "保"}, {"weight": 1.161526114078679, "source": "天", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 0.09368548407732304, "source": "天", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.1041341542702074, "source": "聞", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.8048511701399466, "source": "聞", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.9499834744429492, "source": "聞", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 1.5933085305042167, "source": "聞", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 0.8048511701399466, "source": "今", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.1041341542702074, "source": "今", "target": "安"}, {"weight": 1.8164520818184267, "source": "今", "target": "怒"}, {"weight": 0.8356228288067002, "source": "今", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.410986973710262, "source": "今", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.6377970854767804, "source": "今", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.0279947214541563,